From: DBY-W09 kernel-port draft
Subject: [PATCH DRAFT] dt-bindings: ufs: describe Qualcomm VDDP and VCCQ-parent supplies

Document the downstream Qualcomm UFS host supply extensions used by the
DBY-W09 board description. VDDP is consumed by the storage-first driver
patch as a load-plus-enable reference-clock pad supply. VCCQ-parent is
retained as source-topology metadata for now; the initial ACK driver patch
does not acquire it or submit its 210mA load-only vote because ACK S8 has no
DRMS callback and no proven enable policy.

Both maximum-load properties are required when their corresponding supply
phandle is present. The VDDP driver rejects a zero load.

Apply after ROUND32 has added qcom,sm8250-ufshc to the schema compatible list.
Draft only; dt_binding_check has not been run.

---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/ufs/qcom,ufs.yaml | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 30 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/ufs/qcom,ufs.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/ufs/qcom,ufs.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/ufs/qcom,ufs.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/ufs/qcom,ufs.yaml
@@ -47,5 +47,22 @@ properties:
   qcom,ice:
     $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
      description: phandle to the Inline Crypto Engine node
 
+  qcom,vddp-ref-clk-supply:
+    description:
+      Supply for the UFS device reference-clock pad. The Qualcomm host
+      driver requests the configured load and enables this supply.
+
+  qcom,vddp-ref-clk-max-microamp:
+    minimum: 1
+    description: Maximum load requested from the UFS device reference-clock supply.
+
+  qcom,vccq-parent-supply:
+    description:
+      Legacy Qualcomm UFS host VCCQ-parent rail. This is a separate host
+      consumer supply and does not imply an enable or voltage request.
+
+  qcom,vccq-parent-max-microamp:
+    minimum: 1
+    description: Maximum load associated with the VCCQ-parent host consumer.
   reg:
@@ -64,4 +81,17 @@
 allOf:
   - $ref: qcom,ufs-common.yaml
 
+  - if:
+      required:
+        - qcom,vddp-ref-clk-supply
+    then:
+      required:
+        - qcom,vddp-ref-clk-max-microamp
+
+  - if:
+      required:
+        - qcom,vccq-parent-supply
+    then:
+      required:
+        - qcom,vccq-parent-max-microamp
   - if:
